[^7]: Readers familiar with the field of stylometry will notice that this is the underlying logic of John Burrows's Delta method. See Burrows, John. ["'Delta': A Measure of Stylistic Difference and a Guide to Likely Authorship."](https://doi.org/10.1093/llc/17.3.267) *Literary and Linguistic Computing*, vol. 17, no. 3, Sep. 2002, pp. 267–87.
[^8]: Some readers may notice that this is the formula for Manhattan distance.
